Package: priogridR
Type: Package
Title: Functions for Working with PRIO-GRID Data
Version: 0.7.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Christian",
    family = "Oswald",
    email = "coswald@tcd.ie",
    role = c("cre", "aut"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8291-9544")
  )
Description: Convenience functions for working with PRIO-GRID data, including
    coordinate and cell conversion, geometry creation, spatial neighborhoods,
    weights, spatial and temporal lags, rolling summaries, temporal changes,
    event timing, distances and buffer summaries, panel validation and
    completion, safe joins, plotting, and conversion of raster, vector,
    point-event, NetCDF, and geographically indexed tabular data to
    configurable PRIO-GRID formats.
License: GPL (>= 3)
